<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-007" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">武昌<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0002" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">孟嘉</persName>作<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0005" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_B">庾</persName>太尉州從事，已知名。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0016" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AA">褚</persName>太傅有知人鑒，罷豫章還，過武昌，問<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0034" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_B">庾</persName>曰：「聞<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0039" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">孟</persName>從事佳，今在此不？」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0050" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_B">庾</persName>云：「卿自求之。」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0060" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AA">褚</persName>眄睞良久，指<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0067" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">嘉</persName>曰：「此君小異，得無是乎？」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0082" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_B">庾</persName>大笑曰：「然！」於時既嘆<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0095" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AA">褚</persName>之默識，又欣<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:received:m0102" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">嘉</persName>之見賞。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:family" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:family:m0000" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">嘉</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:family:m0002" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">萬年</persName>，江夏鄳人。曾祖父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:family:m0013" ref="edv_7cp_cl8">宗</persName>，呉司空。祖父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:family:m0021" ref="xsy_ds3_06u">揖</persName>，晉廬陵太守。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin098-mengjia:family:m0029" ref="edv_7cp_cl8">宗</persName>葬武昌陽新縣，子孫家焉。</p>
</text>
